{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51677","headline":"金陵 · 钱弘俶","name":"金陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不用论京口，先须问石头。\n虎山终自伏，带水漫长游。\n青盖曾彰谶，黄奴肯识羞。\n分明前[鉴]（监）在，刚地弄戈矛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}